---
description: Rules when creating python unit test cases
globs: 
alwaysApply: false
---
- tests are saved in `tests/` directory
- test filenames start with `test_*.py`
- tests are using ONLY standard python unittest library
- test clasess names end with `TestCase` for example `ProjectSearchEngineTestCase`
- minimize the usage of mocks and MagicMock
- do not add unittest.main() call with `if __name__ == "__main__"` at the bottom
